"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Officials are quickly assessing the damage from the earthquake that destroyed many buildings and killed 47 people.\",            \"english_title\": \"Earthquake Damage\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los oficiales est\u00e1n revisando r\u00e1pido el da\u00f1o del terremoto que destruy\u00f3 muchos edificios y mat\u00f3 a 47 personas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Da\u00f1o del Terremoto\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Israel's military said it attacked Hezbollah's terror infrastructure after earlier actions against its soldiers.\",            \"english_title\": \"Israel Attacks Hezbollah\",            \"translated_version\": \"El ej\u00e9rcito de Israel dijo que atac\u00f3 la infraestructura de terror de Hezbollah despu\u00e9s de acciones contra sus soldados.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Israel Ataca a Hezbollah\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"New South Wales will give gun owners money to turn in their firearms after an attack happened there.\",            \"english_title\": \"Gun Buyback in New South Wales\",            \"translated_version\": \"Nueva Gales del Sur dar\u00e1 dinero a due\u00f1os de armas para entregarlas despu\u00e9s de un ataque.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Compra de Armas en Nueva Gales del Sur\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A father and his two young sons were rescued after spending a night drifting off the coast of Koh Samui.\",            \"english_title\": \"Family Rescued at Sea\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un padre y sus dos hijos peque\u00f1os fueron rescatados despu\u00e9s de pasar una noche a la deriva en la costa de Koh Samui.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Familia Rescatada en el Mar\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Thousands of sailors on the Lincoln have faced food shortages and broken plumbing, with some thinking about jumping overboard.\",            \"english_title\": \"Problems on the Lincoln\",            \"translated_version\": \"Miles de marineros en el Lincoln han tenido falta de comida y problemas de plomer\u00eda, algunos piensan en saltar al agua.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Problemas en el Lincoln\"        }    ]}"